00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:41.260
I have my ingest and tidy part.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.090
This is where I'm
pulling in from the API,

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:46.930
so I'm registering with both
my database connection, that's

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.783
this line 15, and
in lines 16 and 17,

00:10:48.783 --> 00:10:50.700
I'm registering the pins
board, because I'm going to

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:52.155
to put things in both places.

00:10:52.155 --> 00:10:53.530
So first what I'm
going to do is,

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.930
I'm going to pull down from
the API the number of bikes.

