Connect every 20 minutes.

00:11:25.637 --> 00:11:28.333
So that's great, taken care of.

00:11:28.333 --> 00:11:30.750
The next piece, though, and
this is what I'm going to pin.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:33.030
So this data frame.

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:35.535
This data frame-- this is
the station information.

00:11:35.535 --> 00:11:36.660
So this is, it's those IDs.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.653
Those station IDs,
